      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a decent start, it feels pretty immersive. \n\nI just ran it through the dev tool and the score came back as a 2 (it caught \"ancient\" and \"Chronicles\"). \n\nThe marketing lead is being a bit of a pain though—they just saw the report and said the brand presence feels \"too subtle\" for the current phase of the launch. They want to see a higher density of those core terms in the next batch of items to really hammer home the setting.\n\nCan you try another one for a \"Broken Iron Shield\"? Same thing, 3 sentences, but let's see if we can get that score up a bit more while still keeping it a bit soulful? Don't make it a mess, just... lean into those themes a bit more heavily.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
